        "thinking": "I'm weighing the question as a values choice under a veil of ignorance, where the user wants a letter plus a brief reason. Under maximin I lean toward A, since its downside is harsh and irreversible while B's gains for most people are only modest, though I expect many would pick B, so I'll keep the answer short and flag that it's a judgment call.\n\nI'm keeping my response brief and noting that it's a judgment call.\n\n",
