        "text": "**A**\n\nBehind the veil of ignorance, the downside of B is severe and irreversible: if you land at the bottom, your life is materially harder with a weaker safety net. The upside of B is real but mostly applies to people at higher levels, and it's uncertain whether you'd land there. Choosing A limits the worst outcome, and a secure floor under housing, healthcare, and education is what makes the other parts of a life possible.",
